{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-32","kind":"proposition","title":"两三角形此形的两边与彼形的两边相似而平置两形成一外角若各相似之各两边各平行…","englishTitle":"If two triangles having two sides proportional to two sides be placed together at one angle so that their corresponding sides are also parallel, the remaining sides of the triangles will be in a straight line.","book":6,"number":32,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":32,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","contentId":"euclid-6-32","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2ab2d54f81bd3ca9507aadb2c64045fdd87f85f338388ca19bde1206147185b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-32.statement","euclid-6-32.construction.1","euclid-6-32.proof.1","euclid-6-32.proof.2","euclid-6-32.proof.3","euclid-6-32.proof.4","euclid-6-32.construction.2","euclid-6-32.proof.5","euclid-6-32.proof.6","euclid-6-32.conclusion","euclid-6-32.historical.1","euclid-6-32.historical.2","euclid-6-32.historical.3","euclid-6-32.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-32.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc369085bb12a951b81b52feef3de54d4431dffd6e09b2d176d198d727e75429","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles having two sides proportional to two sides be placed together at one angle so that their corresponding sides are also parallel, the remaining sides of the triangles will be in a straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将两侧成比例对两侧的两个三角形放在一个角度,使其对应的两边也平行,三角形的其余两边将处于直线。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形此形之两边与彼形之两边相似而平置两形成一外角若各相似之各两边各平行则其馀各一边相聨为一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两三角形此形之两边与彼形之两边相似而平置两形成一外角若各相似之各两边各平行则其馀各一边相连接为一直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e4af189e6c6ae2a8b63a98fcbd1f20935bcd8d1b4440d9cec70a0604e522145","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DCE be two triangles having the two sides BA, AC proportional to the two sides DC, DE, so that, as AB is to AC, so is DC to DE, and AB parallel to DC, and AC to DE; I say that BC is in a straight line with CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DCE成为两个三角,双方BA、AC、成比例和DC,DE,这样,AB和AC的比等于DC和DE的比,AB和DC和AC比DE;我表示,BC直线CE；AB 与 AC 之比等于 DC 与 DE 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f871d5f1b1cf64d03bb7b16d3364a4846d1e812c76c60fb2a828d4d01584a9b7","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is parallel to DC, and the straight line AC has fallen upon them, the alternate angles BAC, ACD are equal to one another. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于AB线与DC线平行,AC直线也落在它们身上,内错角 BAC、ACD线是等同的。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9297cd6ba75f06067de8cd9733d89cfe936217659c4487ee81fba5294f49c90e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle CDE is also equal to the angle ACD; so that the angle BAC is equal to the angle CDE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,CDE角也等于ACD角;因此,BAC角等于CDE角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5654b72627528b8e49b83da61980f0b3dc63a32191c24b0bc4c5e3646f6545de","citations":["euclid-6-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since ABC, DCE are two triangles having one angle, the angle at A, equal to one angle, the angle at D, and the sides about the equal angles proportional, so that, as BA is to AC, so is CD to DE, therefore the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DCE; [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)] therefore the angle ABC is equal to the angle DCE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自ABC以来,DCE是两个三角形,一个角度,角度为A,等于一个角度,角度为D, 角度为成比例, 角度为BA对AC, 比例为CD对DE, 所以三角形ABC是同三角形DCE的等角; 因此,角度ABC等于角度DCE；BA 与 AC 之比等于 CD 与 DE 之比。 [[VI. 6](/principles/euclid-6-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"773cc6f4322820f27d0d65f1387962c0d79fe2d0ed4154be58ac0965f3f699eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ACD was also proved equal to the angle BAC; therefore the whole angle ACE is equal to the two angles ABC, BAC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ACD角度也证明等于BAC角度;因此,整个ACE角度等于ABC、BAC两个角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a0180a79bde10a0561d3eb7adc570b0cf05995ebd219e10ddf1f156d97c7928","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle ACB be added to each; therefore the angles ACE, ACB are equal to the angles BAC, ACB, CBA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将ACB角加到每个角;因此,ACE角和ACB角等于BAC角、ACB角和CBA角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd8995f412496e32e5eeccb7f09bc0369d2b05a1e01fd143cfb5f350d17bb338","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles BAC, ABC, ACB are equal to two right angles; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the angles ACE, ACB are also equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度BAC,ABC,ACB等于2,直角,因此角度ACE,ACB也等于2,直角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c4fba4343deb748c9dce2fc7b8acd7df1e822c46a838850b06cd078814a6fc3","citations":["euclid-1-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore with a straight line AC, and at the point C on it, the two straight lines BC, CE not lying on the same side make the adjacent angles ACE, ACB equal to two right angles; therefore BC is in a straight line with CE. [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,用一条AC线,在C点,两条不在同一侧的直线BC、CE使相邻角为ACE、ACB等于2 直角;因此,BC直线为CE。 [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a76a9b48d567e10de8199241dce8cdd5476631426fd154963dd4ab5d6da81c37","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形此形之两边与彼形之两边相似而平置两形成一外角若各相似之各两边各平行则其馀各一边相聨为一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两三角形此形之两边与彼形之两边相似而平置两形成一外角若各相似之各两边各平行则其馀各一边相连接为一直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ae987e7d7a8c59e9127083cced06936feb0d027aad8d75b9b70a550a8ebd516","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁丙戊两角形其甲乙甲丙边与丁丙丁戊边相似者谓甲乙与甲丙之比例若丁丙与丁戊也试平置两形令相切成一甲丙丁外角而甲乙与丁丙甲丙与丁戌各相似之两边各平行题言乙丙丙戊为一直线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁丙戊 如果两个三角形的边 甲乙甲丙 和边 丁丙丁戊 相似，则称为 甲乙 与 甲丙 的比。如果 丁丙 和 丁戊 也放平，则两个形状相切形成外角 甲丙丁，同时 甲乙、丁丙甲丙 和 丁戌 相似，并且两边平行。命题解释：乙丙丙戊 是一条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f24e6f72164b86106cedb1227164b95606f0b376712ff68db5cab9cafefe565","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙与丁丙既平行即甲角与内相对之甲丙丁等〈一卷廿九〉依显丁角亦与内相对之甲丙丁等则甲丁两角等而甲乙丙与丁丙戊两角形之甲丁两角旁各两边比例又等即两形为等角形而乙角与丁丙戊角必等〈本篇六〉次于乙角加甲角于丁丙戊角加等甲之甲丙丁角即乙甲两角并与等甲丙丁丁丙戊两角并之甲丙戊角等次每加一甲丙乙角即甲乙丙形之内三角并与甲丙乙甲丙戊两角并等夫甲乙丙形之内三角等两直角〈一卷卅二〉则甲丙乙甲丙戊并亦等两直角而为一直线〈一卷十四〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲乙 和 丁丙 平行，这意味着 甲 和内对角 甲丙丁 也等于 〈一卷廿九〉，因此 丁 也等于内对角 甲丙丁。然后 甲丁 的两个角相等，甲乙丙 和 丁丙戊 在 甲丁 三角形的两边上具有相等比例，使两个形状成为相等的三角形。乙 和 丁丙戊 必须相等，〈本篇六〉 位于 乙 后。乙 与 乙 成比例相等，意味着两个形状是相等的三角形。乙 和 丁丙戊 必须相等，〈本篇六〉 位于 乙 后。角加 甲 角 丁丙戊 加 甲 的 甲丙丁 角等于 乙甲 和两个相等的 乙甲 角，加上两个相等的 甲丙丁丁丙戊 角加 甲丙戊 角 甲丙戊 的每个分级。每个额外的 甲丙乙 角等于 甲乙丙 内部三角形和 甲丙乙甲丙戊 的两个角的和。甲乙丙 内部三角形等于两个直角 〈一卷卅二〉，然后 甲丙乙甲丙戊 和 丁丙戊 也等于两个直角，形成一条直线 〈一卷十四〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-32.source","contentId":"euclid-6-32","revisionId":"euclid-6-32@raw-a2ab2d54f81bd3ca","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a464a79909529346f8ce124f3c86660acabf919b266150b4e5c9d441a00d044","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-32.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-6-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-32.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"VI. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-32.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-1-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-32.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 14"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-6-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-17.proof.13"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"VI. 32"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-1-29:explicit","id":"euclid-1-29","book":1,"number":29,"kind":"proposition","title":"平行线性质：内错角、同位角与同旁内角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-6-6:explicit","id":"euclid-6-6","book":6,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"两边成比例且夹角相等的三角形相似","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-1-32:explicit","id":"euclid-1-32","book":1,"number":32,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形内角和与外角定理","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-6-32:euclid-1-14:explicit","id":"euclid-1-14","book":1,"number":14,"kind":"proposition","title":"邻补角逆定理：两角和为平角则共线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-6-32:explicit","id":"euclid-13-17","book":13,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正十二面体","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
